(2496, 'D.1.4', 'Each member of the faculty was provided copies of the institutional philosophy vision, mission, objectives and outcomes of his/her program(s).', 651, 'D.1', 2492, '2026-04-22 02:27:42', '2026-04-22 02:27:42'),
