(2574, 'D.2.3', 'The present regular staff members have proper knowledge of the philosophy, vision, mission, goals and core values of the institution as a whole, and those of the program(s) in particular and have accepted the responsibility of realizing those that are relevant to their particular work.', 807, 'D.2', NULL, '2026-06-30 00:23:12', '2026-06-30 00:23:12'),
